  "PERK": {
   "confidence": "documented",
   "name": "Perk",
   "note": "UESP, Skyrim Mod:Mod File Format/PERK. [measured: 76 NNAM fields in Skyrim.esm, each 4 bytes]",
   "subrecords": {
    "DATA": {
     "confidence": "documented",
     "name": "Data",
     "note": "PERK carries two meanings for DATA. xEdit wbDefinitionsFNV.pas PERK: the record-level wbStruct(DATA, 'Data', [Trait, Min Level, Num Ranks, Playable, Hidden]).SetOptionalFrom(4) \u2014 3 bytes normally, 4 or 5 with the trailing optional bytes; and inside wbRStructSK('Effect', ...) the union wbUnion(DATA, 'Effect Data', wbPerkDATADecider, [Quest + Stage (8 bytes: QUST FormID, u16 stage, 2 unused), Ability (SPEL FormID), Entry Point (u8 Entry Point enum, u8 Function enum, u8 Perk Condition Tab Count)]). wbPerkDATADecider reads PRKE.Type from the enclosing record and returns 0 when no PRKE precedes the DATA, so the record-level struct is the union's default. Verified across all six masters: 36x8, 72x4 (PRKE 1), 261x3 (PRKE 2), and 3/4/5-byte record-level forms; the entry point enum is left unnamed because the 74-entry table would dwarf the schema",
     "type": {
      "cases": {
       "0": 0,
       "1": 1,
       "2": 2
      },
      "default": 3,
      "switch_on": "type",
      "union": [
       {
        "name": "Quest + Stage",
        "type": {
         "struct": [
          {
           "name": "quest",
           "type": "formid"
          },
          {
           "name": "quest_stage",
           "type": "u16"
          },
          {
           "name": "unused_2",
           "type": "bytes"
          }
         ]
        }
       },
       {
        "name": "Ability",
        "type": "formid"
       },
       {
        "name": "Entry Point",
        "type": {
         "struct": [
          {
           "name": "entry_point",
           "type": {
            "enum": "u8",
            "values": {}
           }
          },
          {
           "name": "function",
           "type": {
            "enum": "u8",
            "values": {
             "0": "Unknown",
             "1": "Set Value",
             "2": "Add Value",
             "3": "Multiply Value",
             "4": "Add Range To Value",
             "5": "Add Actor Value Mult",
             "6": "Absolute Value",
             "7": "Negative Absolute Value",
             "8": "Add Leveled List",
             "9": "Add Activate Choice"
            }
           }
          },
          {
           "name": "perk_condition_tab_count",
           "type": "u8"
          }
         ]
        }
       },
       {
        "type": {
         "union": [
          {
           "size": 3,
           "type": {
            "struct": [
             {
              "name": "trait",
              "type": {
               "enum": "u8",
