    "EPFD": {
     "confidence": "documented",
     "name": "Entry Point Function Parameter Data",
     "note": "xEdit wbDefinitionsFNV.pas PERK wbUnion(EPFD, 'Data', wbEPFDDecider, [wbByteArray('Unknown'), wbFloat('Float'), wbStruct('Float, Float', [..]), wbFormIDCk('Leveled Item', [LVLI]), wbEmpty('None (Script)'), wbStruct('Actor Value, Float', [Actor Value, Float])]); decider reads the sibling EPFT, and remaps 2 -> 5 when the effect's Function is 5; verified 252x4-byte (EPFT=1) and 2x4-byte (EPFT=3) across the six masters",
